{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Bubbles Must Die! is a tiny, highly-addictive bubble-shooter Inspired by the classic titles like Peggle, Arkanoid and Space Invaders.</strong><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong><br>Destroy all Space bubbles and save the World!<br>Don't let the Bubbles cross the bottom line, or the game will end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CONTROLS:</strong><br><br><strong>AIM</strong> - Use Left &amp; Right\u00a0arrow\u00a0 or hold down the Left mouse button.<strong> </strong> <br><strong>SHOOT </strong>- Press SPACE\u00a0or release the Left mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A excellent Family friendly coffee-break game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive and Simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite replayability as you chase ever higher scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">70 levels full of bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Color Themes and many special Bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of traps to avoid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handcrafted pixel graphics created with love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great music by Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xbox 360 controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains a lot of Bubbles! :O</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697280?t=1746482996","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3697280?t=1746482996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697280/34bcce1dd09439dcf3af1ae4ce4ec4aafc70d